{%- comment -%}
	pill-badge — the small navy pill that straddles a card's edge: the kit
	page's "Free shipping" and "Best value · Free shipping". Renders nothing
	when the label is blank.
	Params:
	  label    — the text (required)
	  classes  — where it sits, e.g. '-bottom-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2'
	             (symmetric centring, so the physical utilities are allowed)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if label != blank -%}
<span class="absolute {{ classes }} whitespace-nowrap px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-main text-white text-xs font-bold">{{ label }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
